(* Parts of a box. _RUNGIEC_LD_SRC: scan 1. _RUNGIEC_LD_INS(npow, pow, args...): the InputVariables, the power input pow (npow is 1 with a power input, 0 without) and scan 2; written only when there is an input. _RUNGIEC_LD_OUTS(n, r, eno, args...): the OutputVariables, eno (the ENO output or nothing), the return value when r is 1, and scan 3, then the end of the Block; n is the number of ENO and return outputs, and the OutputVariables are written only when there is an output. _rungiec_ld_t keeps the choice from the start tag to the end tag. *)
